{"id":"W9ec563c167929ba0d1f16073","zh":"建议谱","en":"","name":"建议谱","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W9ec563c167929ba0d1f16073","text":"建议谱","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S531d550e89c1a30089cd","source_id":"P105","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"其中,建议值的提取办法如下: 针对每个月份的每个波长点(即轨道谱图的横坐标点) ,计算其轨道谱值的概率分布密度,提取概率分布密度最大的谱值作为此波长的建议谱值(见图1) 。","citations":[{"source_id":"P105","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S9b2a67d6f970db0ef46d","source_id":"P105","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"(1,2和3为实测的PSD 最大值,建议值和最小值; 粗实线为相应的平均值) 图3 中,针对每种轨道不平顺类型,从2013 年每个月随机抽取10 个样本(每个样本长度1 024 m) 进行轨道不平顺功率的计算与整合,并与本文提出的武广客运专线上限界谱、建议谱和下限界谱通用标准谱线进行比较分析,结果表明,本文计算得出的通用标准谱线是比较合理的,建议谱线基本反映了轨道不平顺实测谱的幅频特征,而上、下限界谱也较为经济适度,下限界谱表示轨道不平顺处于极好的状态; 上限界谱表示轨道不平顺状态不应超过这个限值。","citations":[{"source_id":"P105","page":3,"page_end":3}]},{"id":"S71af0cb29171a87f6848","source_id":"P122","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"同时,对样本数据统计、计算分析,得到了朔黄重载铁路的拟合谱密度函数结构形式及建议谱的特征参数,通过与国内统计谱函数拟合效果对比, 结果表明,朔黄重载铁路拟合谱密度函数拟合性能更好。","citations":[{"source_id":"P122","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S9d599d6c67acd6096270","source_id":"P122","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"状态分析通过大量轨检数据分析所得轨道不平顺统计谱能代表线路的整体不平顺状态,而通过在轨道不平顺上、 下界限及建议谱框架中,实时检测轨道不平顺实测谱线的幅频变化情况,便能十分清楚、直观的进行线路的轨道不平顺状态对比分析。","citations":[{"source_id":"P122","page":5,"page_end":5}]}],"sources":{"P105":{"id":"P105","title":"武广客运专线通用轨道谱及其反演简化算法","authors":"陈宪麦,向尚,徐磊,贺天龙,陈文韬,贾晨","year":"2016","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2016.02.004","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"陈宪麦等（2016）","overview_slug":"2016-study-on-general-track-spectrum-and-the-simplified-inverse-algorithm-of-wuhan-guangzhou-passenger-sp"},"P122":{"id":"P122","title":"朔黄重载铁路轨道不平顺谱分析","authors":"徐磊,陈宪麦,李晓健,孟宪洪","year":"2013","doi":null,"journal_citation":"中南大学学报(自然科学版)","label":"徐磊等（2013）","overview_slug":"2013-track-irregularity-spectrum-analysis-of-shenchi-huanghua-heavy-haul-railway"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"本文给出特征参数的线路状态参照谱。","language":"zh","source_id":"P122","paper_slug":"2013-track-irregularity-spectrum-analysis-of-shenchi-huanghua-heavy-haul-railway","title":"朔黄重载铁路轨道不平顺谱分析","kind":"paper_usage"},{"text":"由各波长处概率密度最大的谱值形成月度谱，再经平均和拟合获得。","language":"zh","source_id":"P105","paper_slug":"2016-study-on-general-track-spectrum-and-the-simplified-inverse-algorithm-of-wuhan-guangzhou-passenger-sp","title":"武广客运专线通用轨道谱及其反演简化算法","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"Wf22e8265bf6e4e05da035ee7","name":"Suggested spectrum","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null},{"id":"Wf99e803ac6140188e8eab0f9","name":"Propositional spectrum","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"Wf22e8265bf6e4e05da035ee7","name":"Suggested spectrum","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null},{"id":"Wf99e803ac6140188e8eab0f9","name":"Propositional spectrum","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"Wf22e8265bf6e4e05da035ee7","name":"Suggested spectrum","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null},{"id":"Wf99e803ac6140188e8eab0f9","name":"Propositional spectrum","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"related":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P105","title":"武广客运专线通用轨道谱及其反演简化算法","authors":"陈宪麦,向尚,徐磊,贺天龙,陈文韬,贾晨","year":"2016","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2016.02.004","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"陈宪麦等（2016）","overview_slug":"2016-study-on-general-track-spectrum-and-the-simplified-inverse-algorithm-of-wuhan-guangzhou-passenger-sp"},{"id":"P122","ti